#### Client Management

```c
someip_client_ctx_t* someip_client_allocate(Socket_t socket);
void someip_client_free(someip_client_ctx_t *ctx);
someip_client_ctx_t* someip_client_find_by_socket(Socket_t socket);
```
**Description**: Client lifecycle management  
**Thread Safety**: 
- `allocate`: Called from server task only
- `free`: Called from client RX task only
- `find_by_socket`: Thread-safe (read-only operation)

