#### Subscription Management

```c
BaseType_t someip_client_subscribe(
    someip_client_ctx_t *ctx,
    uint16_t service_id,
    uint16_t eventgroup_id,
    uint32_t ttl_seconds
);

BaseType_t someip_client_unsubscribe(
    someip_client_ctx_t *ctx,
    uint16_t service_id,
    uint16_t eventgroup_id
);

BaseType_t someip_client_is_subscribed(
    someip_client_ctx_t *ctx,
    uint16_t service_id,
    uint16_t eventgroup_id
);
```
**Description**: Subscription lifecycle operations  
**Thread Safety**: Mutex-protected, safe to call from any task  
**Returns**: `pdPASS`/`pdTRUE` on success, `pdFAIL`/`pdFALSE` on failure  

**Example**:
```c
// In client RX task
if (hdr.method_id == SOMEIP_METHOD_SUBSCRIBE) {
    BaseType_t result = someip_client_subscribe(
        ctx, 
        hdr.service_id, 
        eventgroup_id, 
        ttl_seconds
    );
    
    if (result == pdPASS) {
        send_ack(ctx->socket);
    }
}
```

